## RACING POINT DISBANDED
> Due to unbelievable inactivity from the Drivers of the Indian based team, who havent came to a race in the last 5 Rounds, Racing Point F2 Team has been **disbanded**. A replacement is to be find swiftly

@News and Media Ping

## BIG NEWS FROM SKIRMIS

> > @Skirmis | 🇷🇴 | 03 is announcing his retirement at the end of the season. He will finish this season to try and get the championship, but he will not be racing in S2 of VMS. However, he has said that that he does intend on racing S3. 

@News and Media Ping

## @LMP [🇩🇪] can clinch WCC at Singapore!

Should the German based F3 team score at least 44 points, they will become the VMS F3 S1 World Constuctors Champions!

